        "chapter": "南山经第一",
        "file": "book/ShanHaiJing/md_chapters/01-南山经.md",
        "snippet": "有兽焉，其状如禺而白耳，伏行人走，其名曰狌狌，食之善走。"
      },
      "description": "有兽焉",
      "effects": [
        "食之善走"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "entity-003",
      "name": "育沛",
      "category": "object",
      "type": "mineral",
      "locatedAt": [
